<<~ ahu slot=`#/meme-header`>>

! Sensorium Machina — Record

This docs record keeps the history behind <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/sensorium-machina`>>. The api meme states the design of record in the present; this record keeps, verbatim, each passage the ever-speaking-present cure turned, so the story of how the design arrived stays findable. It does not outrank the law.

Facts the passages carry: the first design read the sensorium as a decomposition and Locatello's result overturned it; the form plane once vanished from every report while holding 914 rows; the coherence gate reported health on every bed it read; the `admitThreshold` dial left the design once the store inferred the cosine; the 89.1% figure came from one session's live transcript bed; the first memory-sensorium capture ran 2026-07-10; the Hodge-circulation diagnostic got its name in June and no build followed; nine instruments manufactured their own findings before the design settled, the ninth a diagonal Gaussian that inverts at 384 dimensions.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/moved-text`>>

!! Moved text, verbatim

Each block holds a passage as the api meme carried it before the cure.

<<<
''The day that overturned the centre.'' Its first design read the sensorium as a ''decomposition'' — five planes
that FACTOR a stream into independent coordinates. It never did, and it cannot.
''Locatello et al. (arXiv 1811.12359) prove unsupervised disentanglement impossible without an inductive''
''bias'', and the house's own no-imposed-prior law forbade exactly that bias. The ambition and the law ran
inconsistent from the first line. What the machina actually runs — what it ran all along, unnamed — reads
as a ''COMPRESSION'': every plane estimates facets of ONE quantity, the past-future information-bottleneck
in ritual clothes (Bialek–Tishby; #grounds). The two-part code holds the centre (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/sensorium-machina#/the-one-objective`>>), never a
factorization.
<<<

<<<
Silence there is how the form plane vanished from every report while holding 914 rows.
<<<

<<<
reported ''health on every bed it ever read'': the health named a ''tautology'' — one plane heard three
times. ''It was never anti-apophenia. It could not fire.''

The consistency-radius organ (`sensorium_consistency.py`) already carries this in its own header
<<<

<<<
!! Ki ~ the EXTEND register (the section that had to be earned)

''Bands-as-frequency is dead.'' So the machina owes an honest answer to //what ki IS//, and the honest
answer re-cuts the boundary rather than patching it.
<<<

<<<
The reading ''li = STORED · ki = COMPUTED-ON-READ'' ''retires''
''here.'' It fails on its own examples
<<<

<<<
!!! A SECOND axis, and the confusion that cost us the bands

The variance axis (`restrict | extend`) runs ''orthogonal'' to a
provenance axis nobody had named:
<<<

<<<
''Bands looked like a plane because the two axes got fused.'' A band is `induced` (we compute it) and its
//product// — the address — is `restrict`-shaped (a label on the moment). Reading "induced" as "ki" made the
band a plane; reading it on the variance axis dissolves it. ''Bands was never a plane. It was an ADDRESS'',
and the address has ''moved into li'' as a stored prefix code (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/sensorium-machina#/the-grain`>>).
<<<

<<<
''STANDING already knew it was ki.'' `persistence-keel.ts` says so in its own header, verbatim:
<<<

<<<
it now runs on the ONE cohesion signal, and the per-band framing retires with the ladder
<<<

<<<
The `admitThreshold` dial ''DELETES'' — the one knob the design most wanted to keep, gone because the store
now infers it.
<<<

<<<
''Membership was never made of clock. That is why ONE instrument reads both.''
<<<

<<<
''`role == "user"` names TOOL OUTPUT 89.1% of the time'' (measured
this session on the live transcript bed).
<<<

<<<
''And a single-grammar instrument dies on it.'' The bed proved this before any detector ran
(`pidgin_bed.py`, verbatim):
<<<

<<<
status/BUILT; the first memory-sensorium capture ran 2026-07-10 note/
<<<

<<<
status/BUILT; the beds that taught us the category error note/
<<<

<<<
!! Owed / Open ~ what the canon still cannot answer
<<<

<<<
under a green gate, and the machina can say so. This costs no new prior — it is the two-part code applied
one level up, and it is ''the first thing to build.''
<<<

<<<
''Named in June, never built'' (recall, verbatim: *"the coupling Hodge-circulation diagnostic … remains the next ki-side extension"*). It matters MORE now, not less: coupling stands
<<<

<<<
Nine instruments manufactured their own findings before this design settled, and the ninth — a diagonal
Gaussian that ''INVERTS at 384 dimensions'' — stayed ''invisible to every 2-D test.''
<<<

<<<
Disposable witnesses now align owned MiniLM
<<<

<<<
Five deep
domains once read this one instrument in five dialects
